Erzeugt: Armor, Armor Break, Damage Reduction, Mana Absorption, Blood Thinner, Rotten, Thorns.
Gravuren: [nolink]Schutz, Kanone, Bulwark, Damage Reduction, Mana Absorption, Blood Thinner, Rot, Armor, Armor Break, Radius Expansion, Thorns[/nolink]."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_6togp"]
